{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【TGS2026】「Black Shark」攤位報導！可體感手機用高效能冷卻配件與裝置等</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0f969f6d51e62f9fbdd9be07967226a539e1bf4c11f5d0f9fbcc8ccc17861f05/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F4d168e03104d1051a1b88f85be4422a2.jpg\"/><p>2026年9月17日(四)～20日(日)於幕張展覽館舉辦的遊戲祭典「 東京電玩展2026 」 這次為您送上展示手機用高效能冷卻風扇與裝置等的「 Black Shark 」攤位情形！</p><h3>潛入「Black Shark」攤位！展示手機用最新冷卻配件等</h3><p>「Black Shark」攤位</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/50e674d51f457a816c2b9325d99365976e1e75e639d397ae0b0b05861716f872/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc07289a6e27f3482e19d38560e6e463b.jpg\"/><p>來到「Black Shark」攤位了！</p><p>熟悉的閃亮發光「彩虹」！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5476e9c0dfdb3bd44886c77ed672e29319af876731ed428639f6017295091ed7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F77e5809d204525d37aae9f284e27cdcf.jpg\"/><p>進入攤位後映入眼簾的，是Black Shark手機用冷卻器為人所熟悉的閃亮發光「彩虹」，位於牆面中央！</p><p>無線電競耳機與行動電源等</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e61e6db88623dcb9604ff822980a06960bd03fd1c270c8fbb76e0084707e3476/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F943e64d2b9d1ddc2e70d02a6749c10e1.jpg\"/><p>此外，行動電源等Black Shark產品也陳列於整面牆上。</p><p>無線電競耳機與最新冷卻配件等</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5fb707a1dbc18148d588003385b0f47105961599176ff07777af63ab67caf547/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0332edef3a3914e43107d5bf5855f2dd.jpg\"/><p>在其下方，排列著無線電競耳機「Goblin X8」與「磁吸式手機冷卻器 5 Pro」等包裝！</p><p>追蹤「Black Shark」官方SNS可獲得豪華獎品</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5eca925afcc96fde3ffe40a46c44380d1e9b910d40e13460bec598ced2bb832d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F102d6242561b472c5a1a488ff536950b.jpg\"/><p>追蹤「Black Shark」官方X( @BlackShark_glo )即可獲得1個徽章的活動正在實施！</p><p>可獲得原創鑰匙圈！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f662f9ba01034307c5d0c69900ffb6c83dbaffc19407fc8bb4f78813beb90ac6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0a4716940aa2b992348d234e80ffa7ea.jpg\"/><p>此外，可獲得限定版禮物袋或原創鑰匙圈的會場活動也正在舉辦。</p><p>從手機用最新冷卻配件到裝置</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b865bbffd587b01b4079138e614d25f07d437c3dadd9f0daa854be594196688c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0ec2fc08cb786e53f4545e5c02a5b879.jpg\"/><p>這裡廣泛展示了手機用冷卻風扇與無線耳機等！</p><p>無線電競耳機「JoyBuds Plus」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a8dec088a5351358a376b1b09a4d20ec13f92e0b2bfb9d667726b814427dd365/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa39c41912afa4e4d853c08374d26b94d.jpg\"/><p>iPad/Surface Pro/Samsung Tab用磁吸平板冷卻器</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c91ca96d5e6dc6de62e141bcde8f19e0816510fd0912dfcf41699b98f255791d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa17a907a4077a692562d399e11816bee.jpg\"/><p>展出了無線電競耳機「 JoyBuds Plus 」與iPad/Surface Pro/Samsung Tab用磁吸平板冷卻器(BR64)等。</p><p>桌上型電腦喇叭「BS-SP1」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a5f78759412967d4f169554bee3aefa6de5b7d33d328dd36b946b6615942c056/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F450ceb15373dc45a342ad3eec9096464.jpg\"/><p>此外，桌上型電腦喇叭「 BS-SP1 」也登場！ 不僅是遊戲，也能在電影或音樂等廣泛領域體驗充滿臨場感的音效。</p><p>以上，就是Black Shark攤位報導！</p><p>🔸【TGS2026】「I-O DATA」攤位報導！搭載 Mini LED 面板的最新電競螢幕 以及支援 1,000Hz 更新率的概念機種 🔸【TGS2026】「LEVEL5」攤位報導！《雷頓教授與蒸氣新世界》等4款新作開放試玩，還有拍照點登場 🔸【TGS2026】「PlayStation」攤位報導！魄力十足的「俠盜獵車手VI」影院以及MHWA等最新4款作品試玩等 🔸【TGS2026】「MIZUNO」攤位報導！展示電競裝備「ZETA GEAR」與電競裝備「HAGiBiS」還有布蘭卡娃娃 🔸【TGS2026】《KING'S RAID RE:VERSE - 王之逆襲》攤位報導！還原世界觀的梅伊雜貨店登場</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T10:39:00.756828+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1057,"images":11,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}